      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The group appears to be participating in a field lesson on mycology and the identification of wild fungal species.",
          "grammar": "appear to be＋現在分詞",
          "ja": "グループは菌類学と野生の菌類の識別について学ぶ野外実習に参加しているようです。",
